README.md
# Institution Mapper API

The Institution Mapper converts institutional information into a machine-readable Institutional Knowledge Graph.

It identifies institutions, governance relationships, Digital Public Infrastructure dependencies, procurement relationships, AI governance structures, and capability networks.

The mapper is the graph-generation engine of the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

---

## Features

- Institution mapping
- Organization graph generation
- Ministry mapping
- Agency mapping
- Governance hierarchy
- Procurement ecosystem mapping
- Digital Public Infrastructure mapping
- Capability dependency mapping
- Institutional relationship discovery

---

## Mapping Pipeline

Institution

↓

Entity Extraction

↓

